    <summary>Product-scoped Windows Service management (CLI + GUI)</summary>
    <description>
Win Service Buddy manages product-related Windows Services with Simple mode (substring filter) and Profile mode (shareable `.wsb.json` profiles with roles, environments, and start/stop order).

This package installs:

* **wsbuddy.exe** — CLI (added to PATH)
* **WinServiceBuddy.App.exe** — desktop GUI
* Example profiles under the package tools directory

## Usage

```text
wsbuddy list --substring Spooler
wsbuddy info
```

Launch the GUI from the Start Menu shortcut or:

```text
&amp; "$env:ChocolateyInstall\lib\wsbuddy\tools\app\WinServiceBuddy.App.exe"
```

Service control requires an elevated (Administrator) prompt.

